{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":502740,"name":"","username":"dob93","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/d/a698b9/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-28T15:24:03.022Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrokbot Agents\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nSince this morning, my Chief of Staff assistant can’t send messages to my other assistants, like Coffee Updates. It also can’t hand off background tasks.\u003cbr\u003e\nLast week both worked, and my 8:15 AM brief handed off to Coffee Updates normally.\u003cbr\u003e\nUpdating the app and updating the computer didn’t fix it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCan you reset the Chief of Staff (UUID: ab156c99-bf66-4946-b7ae-41bf07ec49b9) to see whether that opens up communications again. I do not want to run a hard reset, as I am trying to avoid losing our chat history.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nHow can you reproduce this bug? We have a much better chance at fixing issues if we can reproduce them!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grokbot\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAsk Chief of Staff to delegate tasks to other bots\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReceive message that they cannot reach the other bots\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nMy Chief of Staff should be able to communicate across the board with the other bots. The entire point is for it to delegate the work I assign. It currently cannot speak ot any of the bots, so they are sitting there doing nothing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nIf applicable, attach images or videos (.jpg, .png, .gif, .mp4, .mov)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOperating System\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFor AI issues: which model did you use?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nGrokBot 0.61.0\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFor AI issues: add Request ID with privacy disabled\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nChief of Staff UUID: ab156c99-bf66-4946-b7ae-41bf07ec49b9\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nEverything was working fine as of Friday. I did set working hours to be 8AM - 8PM M-F. Not sure if that somehow broke the communications stream over the weekend.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes - Cursor (Grokbot) is unusable\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-28T17:24:24.975Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":13,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":65.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":173238,"topic_slug":"chief-of-staff-unable-to-communicate-with-other-bots","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":5,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":140146,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/chief-of-staff-unable-to-communicate-with-other-bots/173238/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_